WEBVTT

00:01.481 --> 00:02.818
(The tassel crowns the knight.
The sword is snow white.)

00:02.842 --> 00:04.177
(In the silver saddle,
he rides like a shooting star.)

00:04.201 --> 00:07.417
(He kills a man within ten steps.
Invincible he is all the way ahead.)

00:07.441 --> 00:13.001
(He would leave once it's done.
No trace of him is to be found.)

01:26.001 --> 01:30.961
=Sword Snow Stride= (Season 1)

01:31.121 --> 01:34.361
=Episode 7=

02:06.321 --> 02:07.922
You could've stopped him to go.

02:11.842 --> 02:13.242
He's been running most of his life.

02:14.282 --> 02:16.162
He can finally face his fate.

02:18.202 --> 02:19.482
No one has the right

02:20.121 --> 02:21.162
to stop him.

02:23.602 --> 02:24.602
Brother.

02:27.802 --> 02:28.802
Slow down.

02:30.081 --> 02:31.081
You are sweating.

02:31.321 --> 02:32.321
Did Old Huang leave?

02:36.201 --> 02:37.722
I got steamed buns for him

02:37.921 --> 02:39.041
from the kitchen.

02:41.201 --> 02:42.201
He would be back.

02:45.921 --> 02:47.761
What are you sighing for, Huangman'er?

02:51.041 --> 02:52.522
If only he hadn't left.

02:53.722 --> 02:54.802
If only everyone could stay

02:55.481 --> 02:56.522
and no one would leave.

02:58.481 --> 02:59.481
Right.

03:00.281 --> 03:01.281
No one would leave.

03:57.481 --> 03:58.601
(Tingchao Pavilion)

05:24.601 --> 05:31.561
(Imposing and Magnificent)

06:23.962 --> 06:24.962
It's so strange.

06:26.361 --> 06:28.082
The Nangong Family from North Mang

06:29.002 --> 06:30.801
is noble and reputable.

06:32.281 --> 06:33.281
My spies

06:33.642 --> 06:35.202
have been digging into it for many days

06:35.281 --> 06:37.882
yet nothing is found

06:38.002 --> 06:39.002
about Nangong Puye.

06:40.082 --> 06:42.522
You should believe your son's eyes.

06:44.322 --> 06:47.041
How good is this woman?

06:49.281 --> 06:50.322
Excellent.

06:51.161 --> 06:52.481
Give her ten years

06:53.361 --> 06:55.281
and she can ruin the world.

06:59.041 --> 06:59.481
Do you mean

06:59.601 --> 07:01.601
Fengnian has luckily got a talent?

07:33.241 --> 07:34.241
I quit.

07:54.401 --> 07:55.601
The vibe of a master.

07:58.361 --> 07:59.562
What is the vibe of a master?

08:00.601 --> 08:01.601
It should look good.

08:08.041 --> 08:09.962
Isn't it
your Coming-of-Age Ceremony today?

08:10.921 --> 08:12.082
Why are you here?

08:13.962 --> 08:15.841
Xu Xiao wants my master to attend it.

08:18.641 --> 08:20.457
(Imposing and Magnificent)

08:20.481 --> 08:21.481
Will he come down?

08:22.161 --> 08:23.161
No.

08:23.322 --> 08:24.322
Why?

08:25.762 --> 08:27.522
This is the cage he made for himself.

08:34.442 --> 08:35.322
The war

08:35.361 --> 08:37.002
has been long over.

08:37.721 --> 08:38.762
Why can't you

08:38.921 --> 08:39.921
let it go?

08:42.361 --> 08:45.002
Do you remember

08:45.202 --> 08:46.642
what people said about me back then?

08:53.841 --> 08:55.122
Can't you let it go?

08:56.721 --> 08:57.721
How?

08:59.562 --> 09:01.241
Hands stained with blood

09:02.322 --> 09:03.601
cannot be washed clean.

09:04.082 --> 09:04.642
As you said,

09:04.682 --> 09:05.841
should I kill myself

09:06.522 --> 09:07.601
for what I did?

09:08.202 --> 09:09.202
No. No. No.

09:09.682 --> 09:10.682
It's different.

09:11.962 --> 09:13.002
My blade

09:13.762 --> 09:15.721
was used to end the chaos

09:16.241 --> 09:17.642
in the world.

09:19.281 --> 09:20.281
Now,

09:21.122 --> 09:22.281
Liyang is unified.

09:22.882 --> 09:23.882
My thing

09:24.921 --> 09:26.122
is already done,

09:26.721 --> 09:27.841
but

09:29.002 --> 09:30.002
yours not.

09:31.882 --> 09:33.401
The banner of Xu

09:33.721 --> 09:35.122
on North Liang's land

09:35.481 --> 09:36.562
cannot fall yet.

09:37.122 --> 09:38.122
Thus,

09:39.041 --> 09:40.721
you can't stop moving.

09:40.841 --> 09:42.161
You need to go on.

09:44.801 --> 09:45.962
You have more to do than me.

09:47.241 --> 09:48.522
You hide here at leisure,

09:49.361 --> 09:51.082
and leave me so many difficulties.

09:53.522 --> 09:55.241
I'm tutoring your son.

09:56.361 --> 09:57.361
You?

09:59.122 --> 10:00.281
You do well, huh?

10:02.841 --> 10:03.841
You may go down.

10:04.962 --> 10:06.042
It is

10:06.601 --> 10:07.961
Fengnian's Coming-of-Age Ceremony.

10:08.042 --> 10:09.082
Don't get it delayed.

10:17.322 --> 10:18.761
Li Yishan is your master.

10:19.641 --> 10:21.201
No wonder you don't learn martial arts.

10:22.082 --> 10:23.202
Commanding

10:23.881 --> 10:25.241
is better than fighting in battle.

10:27.202 --> 10:28.202
It's just that...

10:31.162 --> 10:33.402
It's just that such people
can be advisers at best,

10:34.121 --> 10:35.841
but cannot unite the armies as one.

10:36.442 --> 10:37.802
If I take over North Liang,

10:38.121 --> 10:39.241
people won't be convinced.

10:40.241 --> 10:41.481
Is this what you mean?

10:42.881 --> 10:43.881
You know it.

10:44.361 --> 10:45.681
Why don't you learn martial arts?

10:46.121 --> 10:47.682
If a lord's son is an all-round talent,

10:48.881 --> 10:50.282
how long do you think he can live?

11:01.202 --> 11:02.521
So, you are known

11:03.001 --> 11:04.202
as a pervert,

11:04.922 --> 11:05.922
a loser.

11:08.802 --> 11:09.802
A loser

11:10.162 --> 11:11.162
lives long.

11:21.721 --> 11:22.721
You should go.

11:23.802 --> 11:25.282
It's my Coming-of-Age Ceremony today.

11:26.962 --> 11:27.962
Would you attend it?

11:28.922 --> 11:29.922
I don't like noise.

11:32.042 --> 11:33.042
Fine.

11:33.361 --> 11:33.841
I'm going.

11:33.881 --> 11:39.017
(Tingchao Pavilion)

11:39.041 --> 11:40.161
Doesn't my master come down?

11:40.641 --> 11:41.321
Never mind.

11:41.561 --> 11:42.921
He is old and not very healthy.

11:43.561 --> 11:44.561
It's so cold.

11:44.681 --> 11:45.840
He can't stand it.

11:52.760 --> 11:54.680
Your Lordship. A secret report from
Mount Longhu.

12:02.321 --> 12:05.401
(Jian Jiuhuang has left Mount Longhu
for Wudi City.)

12:05.840 --> 12:07.640
Old Huang has left Mount Longhu

12:08.081 --> 12:10.520
on his way to Wudi City.

12:12.161 --> 12:13.640
He can be back soon after the fight.

12:14.720 --> 12:16.081
No mortal is a match

12:16.840 --> 12:18.480
to the East Sea Wang Xianzhi.

12:20.561 --> 12:23.120
It's your Coming-of-Age Ceremony.

12:23.640 --> 12:24.281
No more about that.

12:24.480 --> 12:25.480
Let's go.

12:26.441 --> 12:27.441
Wait.

12:29.000 --> 12:30.576
The ancestral temple is
in this direction.

12:30.600 --> 12:31.600
I know.

12:32.561 --> 12:33.201
The Coming-of-Age Ceremony

12:33.480 --> 12:35.040
should be held in the ancestral temple.

12:36.321 --> 12:37.321
I changed the place.

12:38.000 --> 12:39.897
As per ancient rules,
we shall pray to Heaven and Earth,

12:39.921 --> 12:40.441
and ancestors.

12:40.921 --> 12:41.921
No.

12:42.600 --> 12:43.120
Neither pray to Heaven and Earth,

12:43.321 --> 12:44.120
nor pray to ancestors?

12:44.240 --> 12:45.441
Where will it be held then?

12:51.561 --> 12:52.841
In front of your mother's grave.

12:54.201 --> 12:55.720
Let her see the day

12:56.760 --> 12:58.161
when you come of age.

14:00.681 --> 14:01.761
When your mother was alive,

14:02.401 --> 14:03.681
these two stone lions

14:04.081 --> 14:05.240
were her favorites.

14:07.441 --> 14:10.681
There are your two sisters
and Huangman'er.

14:12.240 --> 14:14.480
Only you are on this side.

14:16.720 --> 14:19.240
Your mother's love and partiality to you

14:20.401 --> 14:21.520
has never ended.

14:23.201 --> 14:24.281
They say I am

14:25.201 --> 14:27.801
crazy and ruthless,

14:28.480 --> 14:30.401
a vulgar person who has no manners.

14:31.640 --> 14:32.640
I admit it.

14:33.240 --> 14:35.760
Today we won't pray to Heaven and Earth,

14:37.240 --> 14:38.240
only to your mother.

14:51.161 --> 14:53.377
(Xu)

14:53.401 --> 14:54.520
Where is Huangman'er?

14:57.120 --> 14:59.120
You should know him well.

14:59.520 --> 15:01.321
Every time he comes
to your mother's grave,

15:01.640 --> 15:04.000
he cries his eyes out.

15:05.480 --> 15:06.480
Let's

15:06.640 --> 15:08.360
finish the ceremony first.

15:09.201 --> 15:10.201
Let's go.

16:05.281 --> 16:06.281
Our son has come of age.

16:07.321 --> 16:08.360
He's an adult now.

16:10.240 --> 16:11.640
You can rest in peace.

16:20.801 --> 16:21.801
Kneel.

16:33.480 --> 16:34.480
Take the Cap

16:34.801 --> 16:36.600
and change the Gown.

17:19.600 --> 17:21.801
(The Coming-of-Age Text)
On this good day,

17:22.081 --> 17:24.000
you are given the Cloth Cap.

17:24.760 --> 17:26.561
Forsake your childishness,

17:27.201 --> 17:29.281
and have the morality of adults.

17:30.360 --> 17:32.360
Be upright and virtuous.

17:33.041 --> 17:37.120
Wish you health and longevity.

17:38.921 --> 17:40.041
The whole capital

17:41.880 --> 17:43.681
is watching this.

17:45.041 --> 17:47.120
As per the ancient rule,

17:48.000 --> 17:49.281
from today on,

17:49.760 --> 17:51.240
you can no longer wear it.

17:52.041 --> 17:53.161
Afterwards,

17:53.961 --> 17:55.201
you may be an official

17:55.961 --> 17:58.041
and govern the country.

18:03.600 --> 18:04.801
Remove the Cap

18:05.281 --> 18:07.401
and change the Gown.

18:23.720 --> 18:25.041
Kneel.

18:30.240 --> 18:32.441
On this good day,

18:33.041 --> 18:34.880
you are given the Pelt Cap.

18:35.040 --> 18:37.080
May you have an awesome bearing,

18:37.560 --> 18:39.760
and good characters.

18:40.560 --> 18:42.800
Wish you longevity.

18:43.401 --> 18:48.361
Heaven bless you.

18:49.480 --> 18:53.480
The Pelt Cap is for nobles and officials

18:53.961 --> 18:57.441
in charge of military affairs.

18:58.161 --> 18:59.240
Afterwards,

18:59.961 --> 19:02.720
you may serve in the army

19:03.280 --> 19:05.520
and have military power.

19:06.480 --> 19:07.480
In North Liang,

19:08.280 --> 19:10.000
350 thousand cavalrymen

19:11.681 --> 19:13.161
are all waiting for this moment.

19:23.280 --> 19:24.520
Remove the Cap

19:25.361 --> 19:27.480
and change the Gown.

19:33.121 --> 19:34.161
Kneel.

19:39.040 --> 19:40.720
On this auspicious day

19:41.320 --> 19:43.401
of the time,

19:44.121 --> 19:46.240
the ceremony is held for you.

19:47.121 --> 19:48.881
All the attendees are here to celebrate,

19:49.921 --> 19:52.161
for the virtue of yours.

19:53.401 --> 19:55.560
Wish you longevity.

19:56.280 --> 20:00.280
Heaven bless you.

20:18.240 --> 20:20.601
The third one should be
the Lordship Cap,

20:21.720 --> 20:24.681
to grant you the right
of ancestral worship.

20:25.921 --> 20:26.921
I thought about it

20:27.401 --> 20:28.401
and got it changed.

20:38.201 --> 20:39.201
This Cap

20:40.320 --> 20:41.440
is not in line with rituals.

20:43.201 --> 20:44.201
No allusion either.

20:44.881 --> 20:45.881
You can say

20:46.961 --> 20:48.040
it is nothing.

20:49.681 --> 20:51.080
No one

20:52.280 --> 20:53.441
will care about this,

20:54.441 --> 20:55.441
but your mother.

20:56.441 --> 20:57.441
Because

20:57.921 --> 20:59.841
it's the Cap that she made for you.

21:03.560 --> 21:05.280
When she was making it,

21:06.121 --> 21:07.121
she hoped

21:07.401 --> 21:09.161
to see the day when you wore it.

21:09.961 --> 21:10.961
Now,

21:12.601 --> 21:13.841
she can finally see.

21:34.361 --> 21:35.560
To be an official or a lord

21:36.361 --> 21:37.520
in charge of military power

21:38.280 --> 21:39.280
is good.

21:40.601 --> 21:41.601
But however good it is,

21:42.441 --> 21:43.720
it's no better than this.

21:55.480 --> 21:56.480
Yes.

21:57.760 --> 21:59.240
Nothing is better than this.

22:01.800 --> 22:02.800
Come.

23:59.681 --> 24:00.681
Mother.

24:03.800 --> 24:05.121
Please look.

24:09.601 --> 24:11.080
I have grown up.

24:41.480 --> 24:42.480
Where are the others?

24:44.641 --> 24:45.961
I told them to go back.

24:52.921 --> 24:53.921
What are you looking at?

24:57.921 --> 24:59.080
The world is so big.

25:00.841 --> 25:02.040
Standing so high,

25:02.401 --> 25:03.521
I still can't see all of it.

25:04.961 --> 25:06.521
You might not be able to see all of it.

25:08.080 --> 25:09.080
Maybe

25:09.361 --> 25:10.601
it's not high enough.

25:12.881 --> 25:14.240
Isn't it high enough?

25:16.320 --> 25:17.320
The higher you are,

25:18.080 --> 25:19.080
the better you see.

25:21.121 --> 25:22.760
The scene down there is also good.

25:27.601 --> 25:28.601
Fengnian.

25:30.161 --> 25:31.280
As per ancient rituals,

25:31.881 --> 25:33.401
you are a grownup

25:34.361 --> 25:35.681
after the Coming-of-Age Ceremony.

25:40.320 --> 25:41.857
Are you persuading me
to take over North Liang again?

25:41.881 --> 25:42.881
No. No. No.

25:43.000 --> 25:44.000
No hurry.

25:44.361 --> 25:45.361
You can

25:45.401 --> 25:46.080
take your time

25:46.201 --> 25:47.280
and think about it.

25:49.480 --> 25:50.560
What are you trying to say?

25:51.760 --> 25:52.760
I mean,

25:54.040 --> 25:55.040
before today,

25:55.641 --> 25:56.881
you are still a child.

25:57.601 --> 25:57.961
Yes.

25:58.441 --> 25:59.720
Youth is good.

26:00.681 --> 26:02.720
But you are not very thoughtful

26:02.921 --> 26:03.921
and insightful.

26:04.881 --> 26:05.881
It doesn't matter.

26:08.000 --> 26:09.280
I'm your father.

26:09.601 --> 26:12.161
I'm like a big umbrella,

26:12.881 --> 26:14.280
shielding you

26:14.401 --> 26:16.000
from wind and rain.

26:16.681 --> 26:17.681
So,

26:17.760 --> 26:19.040
for the things you can't decide,

26:19.201 --> 26:20.201
I've made

26:20.560 --> 26:21.560
the decision for you.

26:24.560 --> 26:25.560
What decision?

26:32.320 --> 26:33.480
Huangman'er!

26:35.361 --> 26:36.520
Where has Huangman'er gone?

26:37.560 --> 26:38.760
He has left the city.

26:39.080 --> 26:40.080
Don't worry.

26:40.841 --> 26:41.841
He will come back.

26:43.320 --> 26:44.760
You don't want to kill Ning Emei.

26:45.161 --> 26:47.320
And you want your brother
stay in North Liang.

26:48.000 --> 26:50.560
I have to find you the third way.

26:51.441 --> 26:52.441
No killing.

26:53.641 --> 26:55.441
Your brother can stay.

26:55.841 --> 26:58.040
And North Liang won't be in chaos.

27:00.441 --> 27:01.800
What do you want exactly?

27:02.040 --> 27:03.040
Let me ask you.

27:03.480 --> 27:05.921
Why do the officials in the army

27:06.000 --> 27:07.560
get close to your brother?

27:08.480 --> 27:09.640
He was born with great power.

27:09.720 --> 27:10.897
And he is valiant and peerless.

27:10.921 --> 27:13.240
What if he lost his talent?

27:14.881 --> 27:15.961
What do you mean?

27:16.000 --> 27:17.601
I'll reshape him

27:18.240 --> 27:19.921
and let him be a mortal.

27:20.401 --> 27:21.401
That way,

27:21.681 --> 27:22.881
you don't have to kill,

27:22.921 --> 27:25.441
your brother can stay forever

27:25.961 --> 27:27.881
and they won't use him

27:28.280 --> 27:30.480
to disrupt North Liang.

27:33.641 --> 27:34.681
How to reshape him?

27:38.800 --> 27:39.800
In the world,

27:40.681 --> 27:41.681
there are many sects

27:41.961 --> 27:42.961
and martial arts.

27:43.560 --> 27:45.760
One of the sects has the martial arts

27:46.121 --> 27:47.337
that can make your brother's body

27:47.361 --> 27:48.881
change.

27:50.040 --> 27:51.040
Which sect?

27:52.240 --> 27:53.240
The Wudang Sect.

27:53.801 --> 27:56.241
(Mount Wudang)

28:06.641 --> 28:07.641
Xu Xiao.

28:08.641 --> 28:11.161
You promised my mother to protect him!

28:21.240 --> 28:22.361
I promised her

28:23.641 --> 28:25.361
to protect both of you.

28:27.681 --> 28:28.961
You want it good for both sides.

28:29.560 --> 28:31.121
That's the only choice I can make.

28:32.921 --> 28:33.921
The power struggle

28:34.280 --> 28:36.000
is a game of survival.

28:36.040 --> 28:37.921
To make him ordinary

28:38.000 --> 28:40.240
is to give him a peaceful life.

28:50.641 --> 28:53.361
That's the only way to keep him

28:53.480 --> 28:54.641
in North Liang.

29:21.480 --> 29:22.641
Can you do me another favor?

29:24.240 --> 29:25.240
Speak.

29:26.280 --> 29:27.361
Be my bodyguard again

29:27.641 --> 29:28.881
and go to Mount Wudang with me.

29:30.961 --> 29:31.961
The smell of killing.

29:32.240 --> 29:32.921
Are you forcing your way there?

29:33.240 --> 29:34.720
No, to save my brother.

29:36.080 --> 29:38.000
There are 350 thousand cavalrymen
in North Liang.

29:38.401 --> 29:39.641
Why do you ask me to guard you?

29:39.681 --> 29:41.841
Xu Xiao's men are everywhere.

29:45.441 --> 29:47.040
So, your father didn't agree.

29:47.681 --> 29:48.681
It's my business,

29:48.881 --> 29:49.881
and my decision.

29:50.720 --> 29:51.720
I can't help you.

29:53.080 --> 29:54.080
Why?

29:57.361 --> 29:58.361
If I helped you,

29:58.881 --> 30:00.881
your father would kick me out
of Tingchao Pavilion.

30:04.601 --> 30:06.520
I thought we were friends!

30:15.480 --> 30:15.818
Do you know

30:15.842 --> 30:17.480
why I stay in Tingchao Pavilion?

30:24.881 --> 30:26.800
You want to be the Top Master.

30:28.881 --> 30:30.281
Why do I want to be the Top Master?

30:40.881 --> 30:41.961
Because that's the only way

30:43.201 --> 30:43.800
to complete

30:43.841 --> 30:45.681
the oath that I wrote with blood,

30:47.520 --> 30:49.240
to uphold justice for the dead.

30:50.560 --> 30:51.961
It's the only goal that I live for.

31:14.040 --> 31:14.720
Sorry.

31:14.921 --> 31:15.921
No need to say sorry.

31:18.401 --> 31:19.480
I can't help you,

31:20.000 --> 31:21.121
but one person here

31:21.921 --> 31:23.281
isn't under your father's command.

31:27.921 --> 31:28.961
The person out of water.

31:38.800 --> 31:40.000
I forgot him!

31:43.361 --> 31:44.000
Thanks.

31:44.280 --> 31:45.280
Wait.

31:48.800 --> 31:50.000
Protect yourself with Xiudong.

31:50.681 --> 31:51.801
Return it when you are back.

31:53.601 --> 31:54.641
I can't play martial arts.

31:54.681 --> 31:55.720
I could fail the blade.

32:00.560 --> 32:01.601
Take it as kindness

32:02.401 --> 32:03.401
from a friend.

32:16.761 --> 32:18.441
(Tingchao Pavilion)

32:20.201 --> 32:21.201
Eat some more.

32:21.401 --> 32:22.401
Eat up.

32:22.641 --> 32:23.881
Eat.

32:28.401 --> 32:29.401
What's the problem?

32:29.480 --> 32:30.560
Go out of the city with me.

32:31.480 --> 32:32.480
Why?

32:33.201 --> 32:33.560
No.

32:33.921 --> 32:35.961
You promised Old Huang to be my guard.

32:36.720 --> 32:37.961
Will you go back on your word?

32:39.361 --> 32:40.961
Where are you going?

32:41.480 --> 32:42.480
Mount Wudang.

32:43.161 --> 32:44.161
So far?

32:44.361 --> 32:45.361
No, I won't.

32:47.000 --> 32:47.841
You break your promise.

32:48.000 --> 32:49.040
It's bad for your fame.

33:01.800 --> 33:02.800
We are friends.

33:09.401 --> 33:10.401
Xu Xiao.

33:11.121 --> 33:12.121
Look.

33:12.401 --> 33:13.641
Not a single horse.

33:14.080 --> 33:15.720
Your father has taken
all the horses away.

33:16.000 --> 33:17.000
Go out first.

33:17.441 --> 33:18.240
There is a horse market in the street.

33:18.401 --> 33:19.401
We can buy them there.

33:33.240 --> 33:34.480
Your father ordered that

33:34.560 --> 33:36.200
all horses shall be taken
to the barracks.

33:36.641 --> 33:38.161
I assumed you'd make trouble,

33:38.401 --> 33:39.561
so, I asked these two horses.

33:39.760 --> 33:40.441
Would you borrow them?

33:40.641 --> 33:41.641
Two taels of silver.

33:43.681 --> 33:44.760
Let me make it clear.

33:45.401 --> 33:46.520
Given your father's deeds,

33:46.641 --> 33:47.178
you cannot

33:47.202 --> 33:48.841
buy any horse in Lingzhou.

33:50.401 --> 33:51.401
Thanks.

33:52.760 --> 33:53.760
I said you should pay.

33:53.881 --> 33:54.441
I know.

33:54.800 --> 33:55.201
Two taels of silver.

33:55.441 --> 33:56.601
You'll have it when I'm back.

34:00.121 --> 34:01.641
I'm not helping you.

34:02.080 --> 34:03.320
You'd better leave North Liang.

34:03.560 --> 34:05.120
Without you around me,
I will feel easy.

34:07.441 --> 34:08.441
Senior.

34:13.240 --> 34:14.601
Are you going out

34:15.161 --> 34:16.641
against your father's will?

34:17.760 --> 34:18.760
Yes.

34:18.881 --> 34:20.001
To catch up with my brother.

34:20.201 --> 34:21.761
Perhaps we'll have to fight to get him.

34:22.720 --> 34:23.720
Are you scared?

34:25.361 --> 34:27.240
This is more interesting.

35:15.121 --> 35:16.520
I come to see what you need.

35:17.760 --> 35:18.760
I heard that

35:18.961 --> 35:20.240
you gave horses to Xu Fengnian.

35:22.280 --> 35:23.560
Does it spread so fast?

35:24.720 --> 35:25.641
Xu Xiao obviously

35:25.720 --> 35:27.681
doesn't want him to go out.

35:27.961 --> 35:29.520
You will be in trouble.

35:29.681 --> 35:31.161
Why do you fear while I fear nothing?

35:31.480 --> 35:32.480
You...

35:39.200 --> 35:40.200
What?

35:41.361 --> 35:42.976
You two...

35:43.000 --> 35:44.120
Sworn enemies.

35:47.881 --> 35:49.401
This man is so sly.

35:49.881 --> 35:51.121
I've got no chance to kill him.

35:53.640 --> 35:54.841
Did nothing happen to you?

35:55.040 --> 35:56.120
It did.

35:57.040 --> 35:59.680
I was fined when I failed.

36:03.200 --> 36:04.600
Why do you want to kill him?

36:06.680 --> 36:07.761
He robbed me of my money.

36:07.801 --> 36:09.321
He's been bullying me since childhood.

36:10.520 --> 36:11.841
That's not a reason.

36:20.200 --> 36:20.898
Perhaps

36:20.922 --> 36:22.881
to let him get used to it first.

36:29.040 --> 36:30.160
Get used to what?

36:32.200 --> 36:33.361
Get used to that

36:34.761 --> 36:37.761
either of us will end up dead.

36:40.281 --> 36:42.000
What are you implying?

36:45.401 --> 36:46.600
Against fate,

36:47.401 --> 36:49.040
people all fight alone.

37:05.120 --> 37:06.120
Open the gate.

37:06.480 --> 37:08.217
Fengzi Battalion is ordered
to close the city.

37:08.241 --> 37:09.080
No one shall go out

37:09.241 --> 37:10.361
without an order.

37:10.761 --> 37:12.160
Do you know who I am?

37:12.680 --> 37:13.841
In the order,

37:14.080 --> 37:15.040
His Lordship specially

37:15.080 --> 37:16.697
prohibited you, Your Highness,
from going out.

37:16.721 --> 37:18.120
Should we fight a way out?

37:18.560 --> 37:19.921
They are following the order.

37:20.160 --> 37:21.200
They don't deserve to die.

37:21.881 --> 37:22.881
Check other gates?

37:23.520 --> 37:24.961
Xu Xiao won't make such mistakes.

37:25.520 --> 37:27.281
We can pull some strings.

37:28.401 --> 37:29.258
I know

37:29.282 --> 37:30.737
why Xu Xiao asked Chu Lushan

37:30.761 --> 37:32.201
to take Huangman'er to Mount Wudang.

37:33.640 --> 37:35.040
Your father calculated everything.

37:35.721 --> 37:37.480
You've got no chance.

37:43.560 --> 37:44.120
What?

37:44.441 --> 37:45.441
Have you given up?

37:46.080 --> 37:47.400
The barrack name sounds familiar.

37:50.801 --> 37:51.441
I recall it.

37:51.480 --> 37:52.480
Let's go.

38:05.080 --> 38:06.257
You come again, Your Highness.

38:06.281 --> 38:07.000
Outside Lingzhou,

38:07.040 --> 38:08.200
I met you for the first time.

38:09.281 --> 38:10.281
Yes.

38:10.560 --> 38:12.520
I was ordered to bring you back.

38:13.160 --> 38:14.401
You said

38:15.200 --> 38:16.800
Fengzi Battalion was under your command.

38:18.321 --> 38:19.321
Yes.

38:20.961 --> 38:21.961
Let's go.

38:22.120 --> 38:22.441
What to do?

38:22.721 --> 38:23.721
Help me open the gate.

38:23.961 --> 38:25.001
What happened to the gate?

38:25.361 --> 38:27.160
Fengzi Battalion has closed the city.

38:29.480 --> 38:30.480
Why is the city closed?

38:30.761 --> 38:31.801
It's Xu Xiao's order.

38:33.040 --> 38:33.721
If it's a military order,

38:33.841 --> 38:34.841
I shall obey.

38:35.040 --> 38:35.640
I won't go.

38:35.801 --> 38:37.080
He'll ruin my brother's body.

38:40.040 --> 38:41.040
Young Master Longxiang!

38:42.600 --> 38:43.840
Whether we can save him or not,

38:44.200 --> 38:45.281
it's up to you.

38:51.120 --> 38:53.441
Xu Fengnian entered the dungeon
with a token.

38:54.721 --> 38:55.721
Was the token

38:56.361 --> 38:57.520
from his master?

38:59.200 --> 39:01.321
Ning Emei must order to open the gate.

39:01.841 --> 39:03.281
He's the leader of Fengzi Battalion.

39:03.520 --> 39:05.921
His words are orders to them.

39:07.680 --> 39:10.600
Ning Emei admired Huangman'er the most.

39:11.761 --> 39:13.160
He'll definitely go to save him.

39:20.281 --> 39:21.361
Can you catch up with them?

39:22.040 --> 39:23.040
Yes.

39:25.080 --> 39:26.401
Deliver a message to him

39:26.721 --> 39:27.721
for me.

39:30.881 --> 39:32.160
Please go back, Your Highness.

39:32.361 --> 39:33.361
The gate won't be open

39:33.680 --> 39:35.401
until tomorrow.

39:39.801 --> 39:40.961
General Ning is back.

39:43.241 --> 39:44.241
Pass my order.

39:44.600 --> 39:45.600
Open the gate

39:46.961 --> 39:47.961
and prepare horses.

39:49.040 --> 39:50.040
Yes.

39:53.441 --> 39:55.561
(Lingzhou)

40:05.361 --> 40:06.361
Stop.

40:07.761 --> 40:08.761
Your Highness.

40:10.721 --> 40:11.721
Where is Huangman'er?

40:12.560 --> 40:13.401
In Mount Wudang.

40:13.480 --> 40:14.921
Do you leave him there alone?

40:15.361 --> 40:16.601
Do you know why Xu Xiao got him

40:16.680 --> 40:18.040
in Mount Wudang?

40:19.160 --> 40:20.160
He didn't tell me.

40:20.441 --> 40:22.120
He'll ruin the body of Huangman'er.

40:23.321 --> 40:24.600
Don't worry so much.

40:25.040 --> 40:26.200
Only Dahuangting,

40:26.361 --> 40:27.656
the Achiever of Wudang Heart Arts,

40:27.680 --> 40:28.680
can change one's body.

40:28.921 --> 40:30.761
No one in Wudang Sect can do that
for years.

40:34.520 --> 40:35.520
What's wrong?

40:37.000 --> 40:38.361
You don't know it.

40:39.080 --> 40:40.080
Wudang Sect declines.

40:40.441 --> 40:42.441
It's the Chief Wang Chonglou
who is in charge.

40:42.841 --> 40:44.160
He is extremely talented.

40:44.721 --> 40:46.120
He's achieved the Dahuangting.

40:46.361 --> 40:48.401
Has someone in Wudang Sect
achieved the Dahuangting?

40:50.321 --> 40:50.921
Move.

40:51.040 --> 40:52.040
Let's go to Mount Wudang.

40:53.441 --> 40:54.441
Chen Zhibao.

40:58.600 --> 40:59.616
You go first, Your Highness.

40:59.640 --> 41:00.640
I'll stop him.

41:01.441 --> 41:02.441
We can't run away.

41:05.480 --> 41:06.480
A message for you.

41:09.080 --> 41:10.080
Go ahead.

41:10.761 --> 41:12.361
My adoptive father has a message
for you.

41:13.680 --> 41:14.680
Fengnian.

41:15.841 --> 41:17.080
You are now an adult.

41:17.680 --> 41:18.761
You should learn

41:19.361 --> 41:20.480
to make choices now.

41:21.961 --> 41:24.241
It's a dilemma about Huangman'er.

41:24.801 --> 41:26.200
Since you decide to go there,

41:27.361 --> 41:28.361
the result

41:28.680 --> 41:29.881
is on you.

41:31.080 --> 41:32.080
Did he

41:32.881 --> 41:34.200
allow me to go to Mount Wudang?

41:35.441 --> 41:37.441
If you want
to keep Xu Longxiang's power,

41:37.841 --> 41:39.361
you need to make a choice like before.

41:39.801 --> 41:40.801
Or

41:40.841 --> 41:42.680
Let him leave North Liang forever.

41:43.200 --> 41:44.200
Or

41:45.321 --> 41:46.480
Learn to kill.

41:47.921 --> 41:48.921
Kill?

41:49.721 --> 41:50.721
Who to kill?

41:51.921 --> 41:53.001
You can go to Mount Wudang.

41:53.441 --> 41:55.081
North Liang Army must
go back to Lingzhou.

41:55.560 --> 41:56.560
Ning Emei,

41:56.921 --> 41:57.921
Chu Lushan,

41:58.120 --> 41:59.120
go back with me.

41:59.520 --> 42:01.040
He is ordering me.

42:01.401 --> 42:02.401
He's right.

42:03.401 --> 42:04.401
Your Highness.

42:04.961 --> 42:07.081
North Liang Army is
a big concern to the royal family.

42:07.200 --> 42:08.441
Long absence from the garrison

42:08.480 --> 42:10.241
might raise suspicion.

42:10.801 --> 42:11.801
You should go back.

42:13.921 --> 42:14.921
Yes.

42:17.281 --> 42:19.000
For the sake of brotherhood,

42:19.640 --> 42:20.841
please protect Young Master.

42:21.680 --> 42:22.680
You have my word.

42:32.801 --> 42:33.801
Xu Fengnian.

42:34.600 --> 42:35.600
Consider the consequences

42:36.441 --> 42:37.601
before you make the decision.

42:38.841 --> 42:39.841
Move.

42:40.441 --> 42:41.441
Let's go to Mount Wudang.

42:48.600 --> 42:49.600
Here we are.

42:49.640 --> 42:50.640
How to get him back?

42:51.000 --> 42:52.000
Fight a way out?

42:52.040 --> 42:53.520
I don't think the Chief Wang Chonglou

42:53.640 --> 42:55.401
would like to see us directly.

44:56.841 --> 45:00.681
♪ The flower of pain ♪
